        <li class="mb-md"><strong>Delivery</strong> - You receive the report (usually digital PDF), ready to include with your DA submission.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-md text-muted"><em>Turnaround times vary depending on site complexity. Contact Mike to discuss your project timeline.</em></p>
